{{!
    @template mod_datalynx/field_itinerary_search

    Configuration marker for the two address lookups of an itinerary filter.

    Renders nothing visible: mod_datalynx/itinerary finds this element in the filter
    form and attaches an address lookup to the "from" and "to" inputs, writing the
    chosen coordinates into their hidden companions.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * fieldid - Itinerary field id, used to attribute address lookups.
    * prefix - Shared id prefix of the filter inputs, e.g. f_0_1700.
    * typeahead - Whether the configured service may be queried while typing.
    * minlength - Shortest query worth sending to the service.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "fieldid": 1700,
        "prefix": "f_0_1700",
        "typeahead": true,
        "minlength": 2
    }
}}
<span class="datalynx-itinerary-search"
      data-region="datalynx-itinerary-search"
      data-fieldid="{{fieldid}}"
      data-prefix="{{prefix}}"
      data-typeahead="{{#typeahead}}1{{/typeahead}}{{^typeahead}}0{{/typeahead}}"
      data-minlength="{{minlength}}"></span>
